sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Caller
    participant R as Router<br/>(cost-aware routing)
    participant M as Model Workers (N shards)

    C->>R: run(request_count, batch_size)
    R->>M: create shard group
    R->>R: generate requests,<br/>assign each to small / medium / large tier

    loop each batch, per tier
        R->>M: process_batch(batch, tier)
        M->>M: simulate inference<br/>(latency, tokens, cost, ~2% failures)
        M-->>R: tokens, cost, latencies, compute_ms
    end

    R->>R: compute req/s, tokens/s, total cost,<br/>per-tier p50/p99
    R-->>C: final report
